      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>It's just that \"it's possible\" feels like such a lie after everything. it feels like i'm just waiting for the next time i mess up. the cycle is so heavy and i'm just... i'm so tired of being this version of myself. like, what if this is just who i am? just someone who fails over and over?",
